Linear in sequence length, recurrent O(1)/step at inference, causal (no future leakage — required for deployment). The brief already pins MambaLiteSSM (with GRUBaseline as the importable alternative) and warm-starts its encoder core from v1 — so you extend a validated, transferable architecture rather than inventing one. State dim state_dim=6, io d_model=32 (brief §4) bound the memory capacity; both are already sized for the slip subsystem.
